    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "22bn9fr",
      "content": "Minerals are inorganic substances required for structural components and physiological functions of the body."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Vitamins and minerals are essential micronutrients required by the human body in small amounts to carry out vital physiological functions and maintain overall health.",
      "id": "x0e5hx0"
