      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Vitamin B12 (Cobalamin) is the only vitamin that contains a metallic ion (Cobalt), and its deficiency leads to Pernicious Anemia.",
        "Golden Rice is genetically modified to synthesize Beta-carotene, a key precursor of Vitamin A.",
        "Vitamin D (Calciferol) promotes calcium absorption in the gut; deficiency causes Rickets in children and Osteomalacia in adults.",
        "Polished rice consumption leads to loss of Vitamin B1 (Thiamine) in the outer bran layer, resulting in Beriberi."
      ],
      "id": "723e6ca"
    },
